<para>The equation of the line of best fit is \(y = 12.048x - 0.229\), and the correlation coefficient is 0.999. Since there is a direct conversion between the units, we expect there to be a strong positive relationship between the variables.</para>
<para>Since \(r=0.999\), which is extremely close to 1, there is a very<emphasis> strong</emphasis> linear relationship between height in feet \((x)\) and height in inches \((y)\). Since an increase in the value of one variable is paired with an increase in the other, the linear relationship is <emphasis>positive</emphasis>.</para>
<title>Student Activity</title>
<para>Priya takes note of the distance the car drives and the time it takes to get to the destination for many trips.</para>
